/// \see CommandPointsUpgrade

/// \fn ModuleData *CommandPointsUpgradeModuleData::friend_newModuleData(INI *ini)
/// \brief Data factory registered for "CommandPointsUpgrade": creates the
///        module data and parses the module's INI block into it.
///
/// ModuleFactory::newModuleDataFromINI calls it through the registration.
/// It runs the constructor, then, when \p ini is not null, parses with
/// CommandPointsUpgradeModuleData::buildFieldParse, which adds the shared
/// upgrade table and then \c CommandPoints (integer) and
/// \c RequiredObject (an object filter).
///
/// \param ini  The reader positioned on the module's block, or null to
///             keep the constructor defaults.
/// \return The new module data as the ModuleData base the factory stores.
/// \see CommandPointsUpgrade::friend_newModuleInstance


